We let tXptqutPN be a weakly stationary time series (it has a ﬁnite mean and the covariance depends only on the lag
between two points in the series), and we let ρpkq be the autocorrelation function (ACF) of Xptq. A common deﬁnition
of LRD in the time domain is as follow
