Since checking the performance of a resulting ESN is relatively inexpensive, evolutionary methods for pre-training
the reservoir developed (see Ishii et al.
[2004]). Generally, one separate the topology and weight sizes of Wres to
reduce the search space (see Bush et al. [2005]). Jiang et al. [2008] showed that by only adapting the slopes of the
